    "description": "<p>A sonar mask for work at sea: it pings the water around the wearer and helps them swim like its namesake.</p><p><em>Matt Trakker's mask.</em> Wearing it gives +1 Toughness. Its power works only for the agent it's bonded to, a number of times per scene equal to their Speed.</p>",
    "source": {
      "book": "M.A.S.K. (homebrew)",
      "page": 0
    },
